}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le15ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: \tWell everyone, I'd say that because of some really hard work the launch was a great success! The venue was great. Everyone had a good time, the kids were entertained, everyone had something to eat and drink and we sold some books. I think we generated a lot of buzz for the book too and that's always a good thing. What do you think Kristi? It was understood that this was your first launch for us. How do you feel about how it went?", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le15ob11re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "26000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: \t\tI'm really happy with the reaction from the crowd. There were a few extra requirements due to unforeseen events but we pulled together and we got back on track. It was discovered at the last minute that owing to illness, the speaker was unable to attend so we had to arrange for an alternate speaker. Luckily, Thomas was available and it was revealed that he is a very engaging and entertaining speaker. He is so well-versed on the subject of social media that he was able to come and speak without much advance notice. Thank you to Adam for coming up with that last-minute save!", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le15ob11re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "59100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Denise</span>: \tYes, Adam, thank you! It was observed that you were a great assistant during the preparation and arranging for the launch. You were a great problem-solver and really pitched in wherever help was needed. We all appreciate that. The author was happy and said that because of the way we handled her launch, she hopes to work with us on her next book. It was also decided that we would extend the print run of the book, based on the feedback at the launch and on social media. So, once again, congratulations Kristi on your first launch with us. Well done everyone and thank you for all your hard work.\n<br/> <span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: \t\tThank you Denise. It is agreed that the launch was a wonderful success!", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le15ob11re2img07.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le15ob11re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le15ob11re2img05.jpg"}}], "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": [], "title": ""}]}]}